The bundled copy lives at src/Internal/Store/ProfileStore.luau and HAS BEEN
MODIFIED. Every modification is marked `SCRIBE PATCH` in that file and summarised
in its header. A copy of the Apache License, Version 2.0 is included at
licenses/ProfileStore-Apache-2.0.txt.

The licence text is kept OUTSIDE src/ on purpose. Everything under src/ is packed
into the released .rbxm, where a plain text file has no place and whose contents
Roblox scans for off-platform links -- and the licence is full of them. Attribution
travels with the code in the file header, which is what Apache-2.0 section 4
actually asks for; the full text travels with the source package.
